  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The one action per screen; the large full-width variant registers a measurement.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg>Registrar medición</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary{font-family:var(--font,'Archivo Variable',system-ui,sans-serif);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;min-height:52px;padding:9px 18px;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid #3d6ab0;background:#3d6ab0;color:#fff;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s ease-out,border-color .15s ease-out}.ds-btn-primary svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round}.ds-btn-primary:hover{background:#345c9b;border-color:#345c9b}.ds-btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid #9cbde8;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Back and secondary actions; sheet fill drawn by its edge.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-secondary\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 5l-7 7 7 7\"/></svg>Volver</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-secondary{font-family:var(--font,'Archivo Variable',system-ui,sans-serif);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-height:44px;padding:9px 18px;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid #45443f;background:#1b1c20;color:#ece9e2;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.ds-btn-secondary svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-btn-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid #9cbde8;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Toggle Chips",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip-toggle",
      "description": "Metric and period selectors above a chart; pressed fills cobalt.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Peso</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Grasa</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Músculo</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-chip{font-family:var(--font,'Archivo Variable',system-ui,sans-serif);min-height:44px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid #3a3a3d;background:#1b1c20;color:#ece9e2;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .15s ease-out,background-color .15s ease-out}.ds-chip[aria-pressed='true']{background:#3d6ab0;border-color:#3d6ab0;color:#fff}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid #9cbde8;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Input Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input-field",
      "description": "Labeled measurement input; 3:1 field edge, cobalt border and selection-navy ring on focus.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><span>Cintura (cm)</span><input inputmode=\"decimal\" value=\"95,0\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{font-family:var(--font,'Archivo Variable',system-ui,sans-serif);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}.ds-field span{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;color:#aaa69d}.ds-field input{font:inherit;color:#ece9e2;background:#1b1c20;border:1.5px solid #77736b;border-radius:10px;min-height:44px;padding:9px 12px}.ds-field input:focus{border-color:#3d6ab0;outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #34507d}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Envelope Band",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "envelope-band",
      "description": "Navy wool header: logo tile, profile selector, settings.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-band\"><span class=\"ds-band-logo\"></span><b>Mesura</b><button class=\"ds-band-perfil\"><i>P</i>Pablo</button><button class=\"ds-band-icon\" aria-label=\"Ajustes\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg></button></header>",
      "css": ".ds-band{font-family:var(--font,'Archivo Variable',system-ui,sans-serif);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px 20px;background:#1d2a48;color:#fff}.ds-band b{margin-right:auto;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:760;font-stretch:80%}.ds-band-logo{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;background:#fff}.ds-band-perfil{font:inherit;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-height:44px;padding:6px 14px 6px 6px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.45);background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);color:#fff;cursor:pointer}.ds-band-perfil i{font-style:normal;width:28px;height:28px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;color:#1d2a48;font-weight:800;font-size:.8rem}.ds-band-icon{width:44px;height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.45);background:transparent;color:#fff;cursor:pointer}.ds-band-icon svg{width:20px;height:20px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2}.ds-band-icon:hover,.ds-band-perfil:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.14)}.ds-band :focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid #fff;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Weight Sheet With Figure Band",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "figure-band-cell",
      "description": "The ficha sheet drawn by a chalk cutting line; the four key figures as a ruled band of the same sheet.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-sheet\"><span class=\"k\">Peso de tendencia</span><span class=\"hero\">92,5 <small>kg</small></span><span class=\"d good\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\"><path d=\"M1 2h8L5 9z\"/></svg> 0,5 kg desde el 16/11</span><div class=\"ds-band-row\"><button class=\"ds-cell\"><span class=\"k\">Grasa</span><span class=\"v\">26,2 <small>%</small></span><span class=\"st bad\">Muy alto</span><span class=\"d good\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\"><path d=\"M1 2h8L5 9z\"/></svg> 0,3</span></button><button class=\"ds-cell\"><span class=\"k\">Músculo</span><span class=\"v\">36,3 <small>kg</small></span></button><button class=\"ds-cell\"><span class=\"k\">Cintura</span><span class=\"v\">95,0 <small>cm</small></span><span class=\"d good\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\"><path d=\"M1 2h8L5 9z\"/></svg> 1,0</span></button><button class=\"ds-cell\"><span class=\"k\">Visceral</span><span class=\"v\">14 <small>nivel</small></span><span class=\"st warn\">Alto</span></button></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-sheet{font-family:var(--font,'Archivo Variable',system-ui,sans-serif);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;max-width:520px;padding:18px;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid #ece9e2;background:#1b1c20;color:#ece9e2}.ds-sheet .k{font-size:.78rem;font-weight:650;font-stretch:82%;color:#aaa69d}.ds-sheet .hero{font-size:4.2rem;font-weight:720;font-stretch:72%;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.01em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-sheet small{font-size:.7rem;font-weight:600;color:#aaa69d}.ds-sheet .d{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;color:#aaa69d;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-sheet .d.good{color:#9cc79a}.ds-sheet .d svg{width:.8em;height:.8em;fill:currentColor}.ds-band-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));margin-top:10px;border-top:1.5px solid #3a3a3d;border-bottom:1.5px solid #3a3a3d}.ds-cell{font:inherit;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:2px;min-height:82px;padding:10px 8px;border:0;border-left:1.5px solid #3a3a3d;background:none;color:#ece9e2;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s ease-out}.ds-cell:first-child{border-left:0;padding-left:2px}.ds-cell:hover{background:#222327}.ds-cell:focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid #9cbde8;outline-offset:-3px}.ds-cell .k{font-size:.72rem;line-height:1.15;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;max-width:100%}.ds-cell .v{font-size:1.55rem;font-weight:720;font-stretch:72%;line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-cell .st{font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800}.ds-cell .st.bad{color:#e58a7f}.ds-cell .st.warn{color:#e2c36b}.ds-cell .d{font-size:.72rem}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Week Line",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "sheet",
      "description": "Tu semana as a seam: dashed border that becomes a solid chalk-blue cut on hover.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-week\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h10M4 17h6M17 14l3 3-3 3\"/></svg><span><b>Tu semana.</b> Anota cuánto comes al día para estimar tu gasto real.</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-week{font-family:var(--font,'Archivo Variable',system-ui,sans-serif);display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr) auto;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-height:48px;padding:10px 12px;width:100%;text-align:left;border-radius:10px;background:#1b1c20;border:1.5px dashed #5a5853;color:#ece9e2;font-size:.9rem;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .15s ease-out}.ds-week b{font-weight:750;color:#9cbde8}.ds-week svg{width:20px;height:20px;flex:none;fill:none;stroke:#aaa69d;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-week:hover{border-style:solid;border-color:#9cbde8}.ds-week:focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid #9cbde8;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Range Bar",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "figure-cell",
      "description": "Four chalk-tone segments with a chalk dot for the current value, always paired with the state word.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-range\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Muy alto\"><i style=\"background:#8fbbe6\"></i><i style=\"background:#9cc79a\"></i><i style=\"background:#e2c36b\"></i><i style=\"background:#e58a7f\"></i><b style=\"left:86%\"></b></div>",
      "css": ".ds-range{position:relative;display:flex;gap:3px;height:5px;width:280px;margin:12px}.ds-range i{flex:1;border-radius:2px}.ds-range b{position:absolute;top:50%;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);background:#ece9e2;border:2.5px solid #1b1c20}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Pattern Sheet",
    "overview": "**Creative North Star: \"The Pattern Sheet\"**\n\nMesura reads like a dressmaker's pattern sheet, drawn in tailor's chalk on charcoal wool. The ground is a neutral charcoal wool (wool), never blue slate. Sheets lie on it barely lifted (sheet) and are defined by their chalk cutting lines, not by a lighter fill. Everything is drawn in warm chalk white; a pale chalk blue marks what is \"now\"; a deep navy wool band runs across the top like the envelope a pattern ships in. Each person is a pattern piece and each measurement a labeled mark on it. The body figure is literally a pattern piece: a wool fill, a chalk cutting line, a dashed chalk-blue seam allowance inside it, a double-headed grainline down the center, and each girth a chalk-blue band with a triangular notch where its dimension line meets the piece.\n\nThe system is dark, dense and drafted rather than decorated. The pattern world was first built light; the owner asked for dark colors (\"prefiero colores oscuros\"), so the same grammar ships as chalk on wool, and that preference is the reason the palette is dark. Depth comes from lines on cloth, never from glow or from stacked fills. Figures are set narrow and firm on Archivo's width axis, the way a pattern prints its sizes; reading text stays at normal width. Meaning lives in line style: solid is now, dashed is before or alongside, a filled triangle notch is a change. Color is reserved and muted: a chalk-blue fill for the action, chalk blue for the current reading, and states in soft chalk tones (muted green, chalk yellow, chalk red).\n\nThe rejected category default is the neon health dashboard: glowing cards, saturated cyan and purple accents, gradients. Dark here is cloth, not a screen.",
